msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "2027-2028 Mozilla Fellows: Request for nominations"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation will award 10 Fellowships of up to $125,000 to people building technology too early, unexpected, or ambitious for anyone else to fund."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "title"
msgid "2027-2028 Request for nominations"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "Imagining a future worth building"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "hero_description"
msgid "Be a part of Mozilla Foundation's next Fellowship cohort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "hero_cta_link.3cc383f4-b9e4-4c11-a4b7-a638a9334244.label"
msgid "Apply now"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid "Mozilla Foundation will award 10 Fellowships for the 2027-2028 period."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid ""
"We are looking for extraordinary individuals working at the edges of human imagination, on technology that's too early, too unexpected, or too ambitious for anyone else to fund. Our Fellows are "
"builders first, of tools and of the fields around them. But they are also defiant about who technology should serve, and rigorous about making it a reality."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.dcd0d234-118c-407f-81ee-7013fd2d2bc1"
msgid ""
"If that sounds like you, come build with us. Bring the wildest, most radical version of your idea: the one that questions who gets to decide and puts control back in the hands of the people who use "
"it. Optimizing the status quo is somebody else's job. Ours is to build the alternatives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.919eb936-172d-4da3-8d43-1d29cf27498d.label"
msgid "Meet the 2026 Fellows"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid "This year's focus areas"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"This cohort is for people reimagining emerging technology while its future is still being decided. Some are building what moves us forward. Others are building the safeguards that keep us human. If "
"you’re doing either, we want to hear from you. For more information about these focus areas, please check out the full RFP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Neurotech, biotech, and physical AI.</b> Technology is moving off the screen and into our brains, bodies, and land, and we’re backing people who make sure the communities it touches get to own, "
"shape, and govern it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Hard infrastructure: compute, energy, quantum and the extremes.</b> The infrastructure that will define the next decade is being built in orbit, on the seabed, in data centers, and inside quantum"
" machines, mostly behind closed doors, and we’re backing the people opening it up so communities get the data, the tools, and a vote."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Raising p(bloom).</b> Instead of obsessing over the odds that AI goes wrong, we’re funding people who raise the odds it goes right, building AI that makes life better for far more people and "
"breaking up the gatekeeping that hides behind the word “safety.”"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Business models for a post-agentic web.</b> The web’s old bargain of free information in exchange for our attention is collapsing under agents and paywalls, and we’re funding the people building "
"the new deal, so creators, communities, and the open web still get paid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Shared security and audit infrastructure for small organizations.</b> We want to make security work like a public library rather than a pricey consultancy, giving small organizations affordable "
"ways to test, audit, and trust the technology they depend on. Start ups and emerging organizations shouldn't have to break the bank to ensure their tools and products are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Sovereign AI, public infrastructure, and maintenance.</b> Communities shouldn’t have to rent their intelligence from a distant cloud, so we’re funding AI and infrastructure people can own, run, "
"and keep running long after the company behind it is gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<b>Creative advocacy (one Fellow).</b> One reserved Independent Fellowship spot will go to a culture jammer, prankster, or artist-provocateur who can turn a stunt into a movement and make people "
"rethink who technology is built for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.750bb280-efc1-42d0-a8d7-2e4db6266270"
msgid ""
"<i>If your work doesn't fit any of these, apply as a</i> <b><i>Wildcard</i></b><i>. Some of our best Fellows arrived with an idea we hadn't thought to ask for. If nobody else will fund it yet, "
"that's usually a good sign. Come build with us.</i>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "Fellowship tracks"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid ""
"The Fellowship has two tracks for builders at different stages of their careers. Both share the same commitment: developing Fellows into the kind of technology leaders a better technology future "
"needs:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "Track I: Embedded Fellows"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid ""
"These Fellows are working on projects in collaboration with and backed by a civil society organization. Your host provides mentorship and a community to work inside. In return, you gain the "
"experience of turning technical skill into community impact, and your host gains the expertise to advance its mission."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "This year’s Host Organizations include:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>BASAibu</b> (Indonesia)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>Fundación Kamanau</b> (Chile)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>LAS Foundation</b> (Germany)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>Quantum Village</b> (United States)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>Slum &amp; Rural Health Initiative</b> (Nigeria)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "Learn more about each of the Host Organizations and their focus area in the RFP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>What Mozilla provides:</b> $100,000 USD in total, as a $75,000 stipend and a $25,000 project budget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "Track II: Independent Fellows"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid ""
"Independent Fellows pursue their most ambitious idea in one of the areas above. You'll turn your vision into products, working systems and other innovations that advance better technology futures, "
"with the freedom to choose the approach: a platform that proves an alternative model works, or tools that let other technologists build better systems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.024c900c-6fc9-4d42-b1cc-336bd7cd96ed"
msgid "<b>What Mozilla provides:</b> $125,000 USD in total, as a $100,000 stipend and a $25,000 project budget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "How to Apply"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid ""
"Applications are reviewed through a multi-stage process. The primary review occurs at the Letter of Intent stage, with only a small number of shortlisted applicants invited to submit a full "
"application in early 2027."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Letter of Intent deadline:</b> Dec. 17, 2026, at 11:59 p.m. PST (UTC-8)."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Fellows invited to submit full application:</b> Feb. 16, 2027."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Full application deadline:</b> March 12, 2027, at 11:59 p.m. PST (UTC-8)."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "<b>Final applicants notified:</b> April 30, 2027"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.18f89475-52a5-472c-a915-059f5049a039"
msgid "The Fellowship begins on June 1, 2027, and runs for 12 months."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "How to Nominate a Potential Fellow"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Anyone can apply directly. Nominations are an extra route: nominees who meet the eligibility criteria will be contacted with details on how to submit a Letter of Intent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Know someone who embodies this vision? Nominate them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid ""
"We're seeking nominations from our global community to identify the next generation of technology leaders. Whether they're rising star innovators ready to scale their impact or senior leaders ready "
"to pursue field-defining work, we want to hear about builders whose work is focused on better technology futures—powered by people, open by design, and fueled by imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "<b>Self-nominations are welcome.</b> We believe in the power of community recognition, but we also know that sometimes the best candidates are those bold enough to step forward themselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.a11bfa04-7d08-450c-a168-403db154acb6"
msgid "Ready to nominate someone who's building the tech future we all deserve?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.afad71c8-632c-4bad-9640-29e22d604f46.label"
msgid "Submit your nomination"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.642125e8-d4e1-4db6-9c11-8c825d44be94"
msgid "<i>Questions? Review our frequently asked questions or contact</i> <a id=\"a1\"><i>fellowships@mozillafoundation.org</i></a><i>.</i>"
msgstr ""
